{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "9226d030eaa1d60669f8553010133850a6bd77bfe25214edf0db07ef1f72d06e", "ja": "ふふっ♪　あとで桃子ちゃんと\n環ちゃんにも、教えてあげなくちゃ……♪", "zh": "呵呵♪待会儿也得教教桃子和环才行……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6b36ae99b5889e55852701cbfc903a221bb40797253b6efb0382c9e6b5443428", "ja": "育、お疲れさま。\n熱心に鏡を見て、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "育，辛苦了。\n一直这么认真地照着镜子，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "5b114648a19d1719cc5016e741f363f3d56c45dc4288f5a9998f44978e73c72c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nあのね、わたし……あっ、そうだ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那个，我……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "9699c79314c23d7ab74737c75e629b111e3476a1bdb41685458e49ec03901805", "ja": "せっかくだから、{$P$}さんにも\n聞いてみるね。えへへ。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我也去问问{$P$}先生吧。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "09384ab72d38c6d55e8023d7aec74635a62b1b8004e77555b8c1bede034efe12", "ja": "わたし、昨日にくらべて、変わったところがあるんだ！\nさて、どこが変わったでしょう？", "zh": "我和昨天相比，有一点不一样哦！\n那么，是哪里变了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d3247341f2d67b175ba9b0a4790440b1b4ff1d20ee359ba10fd128ad9b82df26", "ja": "えっ。昨日と比べて、変わったところか？\nうーん……。", "zh": "咦？和昨天相比，有什么变化吗？\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "257a37dec6146a3c131b8a2843888ba6f882442417445e383a0997c290f4fbe7", "ja": "じー……。", "zh": "（盯）…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5e37b954d37e912e4b387a6d49108ae641b7ec55668d24a85bf5e259e2069f87", "ja": "……そうか！　シャンプーを変えたんだな？\nいつもより、髪がサラサラな気がする！", "zh": "……这样啊！你换洗发水了吧？\n感觉头发比平时还要柔顺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "5e60a366e1026960e72fae7253ceb2c99d4c34f5d270e2d14111f521aadde62b", "ja": "ブー！\nもう、違うよ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嘟——！\n真是的，不对啦，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "639330bdf7880e0699108033e405fa1e8344e11df974358e6d1ef4db59443d24", "ja": "{$P$}さんはわたしの\nプロデューサーなんだから、正解しなくちゃダメだよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生可是我的\n制作人，必须要答对才行啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1010_p", "source_sha256": "45f264300f341d70fea18e08cd41a0e66b10a3bcfeec010e0fb0072f42b78188", "ja": "そ、そうだな……ごめん。\nそれで、正解は何だったんだ？", "zh": "对、对啊……抱歉。\n所以，正确答案是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "d4a73d6d32b9efd1918afcfa66676eb691ab11b6619bab7828f57aff4d5e3318", "ja": "あのね、今朝おかあさんに測ってもらったんだけど。\n……わたし、昨日より身長が3ミリも伸びてたんだよ！", "zh": "我说呀，今天早上妈妈帮我量了身高。\n……我居然比昨天长高了整整3毫米哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "7b2b64325c067d1c415c3b6ec5d02f62b66a8cc09f8243310ebe1958d1fb7def", "ja": "どう？　すごいでしょ？　えへへ……♪", "zh": "怎么样？很厉害吧？嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7325c7b93267409d6ce8aa9bd6a0f19b176e3477afa42a91ba7b8a40e9b7ca7a", "ja": "さ、3ミリか……。\nそれは流石に、気づけなかったな……。", "zh": "啊，3毫米吗……。这个我确实没注意到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "e56bc401f6a420218f7f0ece6f4d1156736e67b82a05949cf5ae2fb09a34930e", "ja": "やっぱり、牛乳って効果あるんだね！\nこれならきっと、すぐにこのみさんを追い越せるよ！", "zh": "果然，牛奶还是有效果的呢！\n这样一来，我肯定很快就能超过木实姐姐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "9e235e9c9226298c30d4dc6e8c8ab69bc2eed1f555d175bb8bfe3bf7aec6c10f", "ja": "それに牛乳って、美肌効果もあるんだって！\nわたしも、キレイになるかなぁ？", "zh": "而且听说牛奶还有美肌效果呢！\n我也会变漂亮吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b4d8d67eb56ebb8ec18b4e327725f3987a44aab992ca9ed9e28c6fdf5e9b4366", "ja": "そうだな！　育は今のままでも可愛いけど、\nその上綺麗になったら、最強だな！", "zh": "没错！育现在这样就已经很可爱了，\n要是还能变得更漂亮，那就无敌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "acc1ddbd80176794cb580f0586fbffd406b447435ca5393e51a15c0e2d9cd8f5", "ja": "えへへ、まかせて！　今は、環ちゃんや\n桃子ちゃんのほうが、わたしより大人っぽいけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，交给我吧！现在环和桃子都比我更成熟，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0203_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "4e3286e2fd569f6449f466d036159cf3aeb71ffffd985878f701f9371d03d51c", "ja": "すぐに成長して、みんなに追い着くんだから♪\n{$P$}さん、楽しみにしててね！", "zh": "我会马上成长起来，追上大家的♪\n{$P$}先生，要期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
